The GDN chunked-prefill kernels ggml/src/ggml-cuda/gdn-chunk-sm70/gdn-chunk-cumsum-hv12.cuh,
gdn-chunk-kkt.cuh and gdn-chunk-fwd.cuh are TileLang-generated code of the FlashQLA kernels
tilelang_chunk_local_cumsum (flash_qla/ops/utils/cumsum.py), tilelang_kkt_solve
(flash_qla/ops/gated_delta_rule/chunk/hopper/kkt_solve.py) and tilelang_fused_chunk_gdr_fwd
(flash_qla/ops/gated_delta_rule/chunk/hopper/fused_fwd.py), as 1Cat-vLLM
(https://github.com/1CatAI/1Cat-vLLM) builds them for sm_70. FlashQLA is under the license below;
the TileLang templates are under licenses/LICENSE-tilelang and 1Cat-vLLM
under licenses/LICENSE-1Cat-vLLM.

